    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "一個人走回營。手電筒握得太緊。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "沙沙。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "左手邊。不遠。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "沙沙。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "風？還是別的什麼。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他想起游牧那句——不敢做的人，就做不到。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "管了。轉過去。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "audio",
      "action": "play",
      "channel": "bgm",
      "asset": "bgm-10-i-swear-i-saw-it"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "星光底下，兩個人影。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "一個是家綸。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "手電筒沒有照過去。他把它關掉。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "漫天星火下示愛。這小子真行。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他以為前面是綺珊。背光看不清臉，只覺得那影子忽然柔了，不像白天那個鐵娘子。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "家綸眼下有淚。嘴在動。像在說一句要說很久的話。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "女孩的身影，抖了一下。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "獵戶座底下，兩人慢慢靠攏。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "擁在一起。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "參宿四的紅光落下來。星光、燈光、淚。臉一寸寸清楚。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "男孩掛著傷痛的俊。女孩的臉被淚洗過，乾淨得刺眼。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "是素婷。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "戀人背後，星光照不到的角落——"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "一顆淚，落進漆黑裡。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch12-year"
    }
  ]
}
